OL,3,GNEWSADementia podcast shortlisted for
OL,4,Anational awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA podcast helping people understand
OL,7,Fdementia has been shortlisted for two
OL,8,Fcategories at this year's British
OL,9,FPodcast Awards.
OL,11,FThe Dementia Perspective, produced by
OL,12,FGuernsey Alzheimer's Association and
OL,13,Fpodcast host Ollie Guillou, is in the
OL,14,Frunning for both the Health and
OL,15,FWellbeing Award and the Specialist
OL,16,FAward, a category chosen by the judges.
OL,18,FThe podcast was launched to help people
OL,19,Flearn more about brain health, dementia
OL,20,Fprevention and the realities of living
OL,21,Fwith the condition.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
